+@startuml
+!theme plain
+title TASK-260715-whtdsf — CI trust boundary
+
+actor "Fork / untrusted PR" as Fork
+actor "Trusted maintainer" as Maintainer
+queue "v* tag event" as Trigger
+component "Unprivileged tag intake\n(event completion only)" as Intake
+
+rectangle "Credential-free CI" as PRCI {
+  component "Board/spec + workflow policy" as Policy
+  component "Core/protocol + macOS compile + relay matrix" as Tests
+  component "Secret/license/SBOM policy" as Scans
+}
+
+rectangle "Protected release preparation" as Prepare {
+  component "Default-branch workflow_run\n+ trusted workflow/policy digest" as TrustedEntry
+  component "Immutable candidate manifest" as Manifest
+  component "Fresh required-check evidence" as Revalidate
+}
+
+rectangle "Serialized promotion" as Promote
+node "macOS signing/notary environment" as MacEnv
+node "Sparkle signing environment" as SparkleEnv
+node "Relay staging environment" as RelayEnv
+artifact "Digest-bound redacted evidence" as Evidence
+
+Fork --> PRCI : read-only token\nno production environment or secrets
+Maintainer --> PRCI : identical required checks
+PRCI --> Evidence : results + manifests + digests
+Trigger --> Intake : arbitrary tagged workflow code\nno secrets, cache, artifacts, or authority
+Intake --> TrustedEntry : completion metadata only\nnever intake output/code/artifacts
+TrustedEntry --> Manifest : independently resolve tag/ref/ancestry\nexact workflow SHA + policy digest
+Manifest --> Revalidate : exact protected-branch commit
+Evidence --> Revalidate : exact-head checks
+Revalidate --> Promote : accepted candidate only
+Promote --> RelayEnv : scoped staging credential
+Promote --> MacEnv : scoped Developer ID/notary material
+MacEnv --> SparkleEnv : final notarized DMG digest only
+RelayEnv --> Evidence
+MacEnv --> Evidence
+SparkleEnv --> Evidence
+
+note bottom of PRCI
+No protected environment, signing material,
+publication token, privileged runner, or trusted
+release cache/artifact is reachable from PR code.
+All macOS-path blocking checks run on GitHub-hosted
+macOS; optional relay-native Linux evidence is separate.
+end note
+
+note bottom of Promote
+One production concurrency group.
+Assets first; signed feed last.
+Cancellation or unknown evidence is non-promotable.
+end note
+
+note bottom of Intake
+Deleting or forging the guard in a tagged workflow
+cannot accept a candidate. Missing/ambiguous metadata,
+selectable-ref dispatch, relative workflow calls, or
+workflow/policy digest mismatch fails before environment access.
+end note
+@enduml
